WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:05,473
Ayu

2
00:00:05,473 --> 00:00:09,682
You try here

3
00:00:09,682 --> 00:00:13,890
I'll go out and have a look

4
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:16,361
Mrs. Xu caught wind and cold a few days ago

5
00:00:16,361 --> 00:00:18,090
Xiuwen, this child is filial

6
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:20,561
Waiting in front of the bed without hesitation

7
00:00:20,561 --> 00:00:22,290
This delayed the visit to the countryside

8
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:28,290
I guess it’s because I was a junior, I was so busy that I forgot the message. I’ve visited several restaurants in my hometown in the past half month.

9
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:33,690
Either they think we are poor, or the dowry is too small, and we go back and forth, but the money given to us by this merchant is the best to cheat.

10
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:36,290
If you lower your head a little, they won't dare to show mercy.

11
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:43,090
Is that so? My Xiuwen family is very young and is a good candidate. How many people can there be in Chang'an?

12
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:47,090
It's not something that anyone can easily climb up to.
